  "text": "Good evening, this is the news from Paris. Yesterday was the first day of the Paris Motor Show. The halls were very crowded: there were thousands of visitors. The tickets were twenty euros. The weather was rainy, but the visitors were happy. The new electric cars were the stars of the day.",
